#: advanced.cpp:93 main.cpp:200
msgid ""
"Failed to activate desktop effects using the given configuration options. Settings will be reverted to their previous values.\n"
"\n"
"Check your X configuration. You may also consider changing advanced options, especially changing the compositing type."
msgstr ""
"Mit de angeven Instellen laat sik de Schriefdischeffekten nich anmaken. De Instellen warrt op ehr verleden Weerten torüchsett.\n"
"\n"
"Prööv bitte Dien X-Instellen. Villicht schullst Du ok wat an de verwiederten Instellen maken, sünnerlich den Tosamensett-Typ."

